\section{Mathematical Formulation}{


The Pella-Tomlinson model is defined by:

Production function: P(B) = r × B × (1 - (B/K)^(m-1)) / m

State equation: \deqn{B[t+1] = B[t] + P(B[t]) - C[t] + ε[t]}

Observation equation: \deqn{CPUE[t] = q × B[t] × exp(η[t])}
}

